{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/630fa4bbad22836764d51ccd62667315.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player or Local PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unity Game engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG/RTS game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good Story in single player.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colonyship finds a very old solar system called Battlegeuse. General Brenner takes one of his best men, Captain Carter, known for his space explorations, and gives him a very difficult task: recovering information from the planets to defeat the lingering threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the mission reveals the true story of Battlegeuse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLSTARS 26</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start from the colonizing spaceship as a planet explorer where you can create and compose different materials from your rooms, arm your ships and explore the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b3dcd1c781f0fe91993735202e809488.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Colony Ship, examine objects found on the planets of the solar system, upgrade your spaceships from the command bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/10e44f200466e7ee3aa032f1a2885e32.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration of the planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious locations in search of answers to the history of Battlegeuse and fight with the enemies you find on your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/f3804744e4a88d3ae04075e0a974d678.poster.avif?t=1771317414\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/f3804744e4a88d3ae04075e0a974d678.webm?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/f3804744e4a88d3ae04075e0a974d678.mp4?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the project we included fluid dynamics simulation for lava from the planet's volcanoes and water simulation for colder planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b4f2b5f917ba7226760a663eccd9f9e6.poster.avif?t=1771317414\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b4f2b5f917ba7226760a663eccd9f9e6.webm?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b4f2b5f917ba7226760a663eccd9f9e6.mp4?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the planet's secret areas and explore with your character in third-person.The player will uncover the truth piece by piece, through blueboxes, secret diaries, and forensic analysis of the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/3a3f4c6fb5310cbfbe67b9c83e8a1a90.poster.avif?t=1771317414\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/3a3f4c6fb5310cbfbe67b9c83e8a1a90.webm?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/3a3f4c6fb5310cbfbe67b9c83e8a1a90.mp4?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exploration of the bases is in first person &quot;alien&quot; style for a diversification of the gaming perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/9703bab3814ac5b523aba560025e6662.poster.avif?t=1771317414\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/9703bab3814ac5b523aba560025e6662.webm?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/9703bab3814ac5b523aba560025e6662.mp4?t=1771317414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player VS Player Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your fleet of ships and fight against each other to conquer the Battlegeuse solar system.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 fleets for each player to play with, each of these has different properties, speed, energy consumption, etc.. The goal is to destroy the opponent's mothership on each planet of the solar system, conquered all the planets, the player wins the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/a53ce0eb09ca05e1f19f34982dee345b.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build special buildings to defend your conquered planet. There are 7 different modules, each with unique potential. It is up to you and your strategy to buy the right module.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy a better spaceship. In Battlegeuse you have many different strategies to get the better of your enemy, having the fastest and most agile ship is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b1b70da558b44111713b6f41f4ed95ec.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1771317414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1771317414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/101c6eaed7098988e37cad704b0e0e56a6c27ec0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771317414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/101c6eaed7098988e37cad704b0e0e56a6c27ec0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771317414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/630fa4bbad22836764d51ccd62667315.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player or Local PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unity Game engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG/RTS game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good Story in single player.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The colonyship finds a very old solar system called Battlegeuse. General Brenner takes one of his best men, Captain Carter, known for his space explorations, and gives him a very difficult task: recovering information from the planets to defeat the lingering threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the mission reveals the true story of Battlegeuse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLSTARS 26</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start from the colonizing spaceship as a planet explorer where you can create and compose different materials from your rooms, arm your ships and explore the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b3dcd1c781f0fe91993735202e809488.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Colony Ship, examine objects found on the planets of the solar system, upgrade your spaceships from the command bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/10e44f200466e7ee3aa032f1a2885e32.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration of the planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious locations in search of answers to the history of Battlegeuse and fight with the enemies you find on your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https