y a better spaceship. In Battlegeuse you have many different strategies to get the better of your enemy, having the fastest and most agile ship is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/b1b70da558b44111713b6f41f4ed95ec.avif?t=1771317414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Laboriontech Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/41018c6facb3eccc7fc274f85f101eb4389bf81e/header.jpg?t=1771317414","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3653240/1395608898/9ab119106cbab1b6a237bfc5fae7b759ee9bf8b4/1770372434/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770374141","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3653240/1395608898/9ab119106cbab1b6a237bfc5fae7b759ee9bf8b4/1770372434/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770374141","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3653240/1395608898/9ab119106cbab1b6a237bfc5fae7b759ee9bf8b4/1770372434/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770374141","id":257123725,"name":"tutorial1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123725/632d5fa2181a328822358d6e7e20cd21e55c2ec1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770374141"}],"name":"Battlegeuse","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or leater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stron